WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:05.469
P1.1 · P&L year to date, cumulative balance sheet

2
00:00:06.619 --> 00:00:10.669
The P&L restarts at zero at the start of each fiscal year.

3
00:00:10.719 --> 00:00:14.170
The balance sheet is cumulative: balances at a date.

4
00:00:16.619 --> 00:00:21.056
Statements are built from the ledger lines and each account's classification.

5
00:00:21.106 --> 00:00:25.261
A group view brings the entities together in the reporting currency.

6
00:00:26.411 --> 00:00:29.939
If either fails, look at account classification first.

7
00:00:34.711 --> 00:00:38.445
